Description


Hello Technologies Private Limited is excited to welcome a talented and motivated Software Developer - Fresher to our innovative team. This full-time remote position offers an excellent opportunity for recent graduates and entry-level professionals to kick-start their careers in the dynamic field of Computer Software and Engineering.

As a Software Developer, you will have the chance to work on a variety of projects that leverage cutting-edge technologies, allowing you to contribute to meaningful software solutions. Join us in our mission to deliver high-quality software that meets the needs of our clients and enhances user experience. This role not only promises valuable hands-on experience but also a supportive environment for your professional growth.

We offer a competitive salary range of ₹300,000 - ₹450,000 annually, along with a range of benefits and opportunities for skill development.

Responsibilities
Assist in the design and development of software applications
Write clean, efficient, and maintainable code
